1.0.3
* Added support for Consuming items such as Stims/drugs etc.
* Added support for Roll types. All are supported except for Blind rolling which will get fixed further down.

1.0.5
* Fixed a bug where GET_ACTORS would not pass back tokenIDs, stopping the character from saving properly within the app.
* LIST_TOKENS would also fail as a result, failing the token distance function

1.0.6
* Added support for EuroBuck changes (set, subtract and add) + transaction titles
* Added support for Net Pools, integrating a new JournalType to allow the Agent to create a fake net.

1.0.7/8
* Fixed bug where ActorID was not sent back
* Strong typed response names
* Fixed offline bug

1.1.0
* Added support for QR connection with Agent for GM and Players
* Added pastebin style connections for Desktop users
* Fixed DV table bugs not returning correct value
* Refactored filebase to preserve scalability and improve readability of components.
* Trigger form update when the GM updates server inputs.
* Better error handling to point to connection errors.